# FamilyBizness rules

- Canonical identity: `docs/00 - Canonical/Identity.md` — link, don’t duplicate.
- Tokens: only `packages/tokens/tokens.css` — never hardcode colours/fonts/spacing from memory.
- Folders: numbered function names (`01 - Notes/`, …); one home per topic; `Subject - Description.ext` Title Case; no version numbers in filenames.
- New non-obvious folder → one-line README.
- Keep Trace, Architecture, Design.md current.
- `donor/` contender clones: never commit (except README placeholders). Prefer contender → static UI → integrate over greenfield full app.
- Don’t build full auth / portfolio engines / financial models unless asked.
- Release blockers: poor text contrast; overlapping chart labels — render and verify before shipping.
- Preview app: `apps/web` Bun static → `dist/` → `gh-pages` branch → https://kartavya.tech/FamilyBizness/ (`main` does not deploy). Brand-first hero; pillars after first viewport.
- Docs: plain Markdown only. MkDocs is retired — never add it.
- SEO/agent files (`robots.txt`, `sitemap.xml`, `llms.txt`, OG cards, JSON-LD): see `AGENTS.md`.
